## Program Outcome

App Server planning can safely prepare large Tool Shed work from a compact deterministic manifest
and bounded retrieval of declared source ranges. It cannot read outside the snapshot, exceed
per-read or cumulative budgets, silently plan from insufficient context, or lose content-free
retrieval evidence. The exact behavior is qualified, released, production-verified, and recursively
reconciled.

